  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingLossOnDisposalOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: left"&gt;※２　固定資産除却損の内容は次のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 647.99999999999999999999999999px"&gt;
